Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:34:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): project-mode rows past the recents page no
 longer paint green while their /goal, cards or background jobs run [daveey]

The project tree's session rows carried none of the activity stamps the session
lists do (goal_active, kanban_active/blocked, cron_active, background_active),
and $sessionDotStateById only reads those stamps off $sessions. A project-mode
row older than the recents page exists only in the tree, so e.g. a session
parked on an active /goal painted done (green).

- tui_gateway: _project_tree_inputs stamps all four on the tree rows (previews
  and hydrated lanes share the dicts), for projects.tree, project_sessions and
  the all-profiles REST tree.
- desktop: withRowActivity folds a row's own stamps into its dot state in the
  sidebar row and the status dot.
